[gd_resource type="SpriteFrames" load_steps=32 format=3 uid="uid://cklnfrm8way01"]

; Klein's directional frames, normalised onto the 941x1040 / feet@y986 canvas so
; Player.tscn's scale + offset and the interior-scene scale overrides all apply unchanged.
;
; IDLE: five DRAWN directions (s, n, e, se, ne) sliced from asset-gen klein-8way.png. The
; west-ward octants (w, sw, nw) reuse the east art mirrored via AnimatedSprite2D.flip_h in
; Player.gd, so only the right-hand side + cardinals are stored.
;   idle_s = R1C1 (front)   idle_n = R2C1 (back)   idle_e = R2C3 (right profile)
;   idle_se = R2C4 (front-right 3/4)   idle_ne = R2C2 (back-right 3/4)
;
; WALK: walk_e is a 9-frame side-walk cycle (faces east), gray-keyed + re-centred to walk in
; place from a video (ezgif frames 010-018). Player.gd plays walk_<dir> when moving and mirrors
; walk_e for west. walk_s (front, 7f) and walk_n (back, 10f) come from their own videos. The
; diagonals (se/ne + west mirrors) still reuse walk_e as the nearest walk. Per-direction speeds
; speeds: walk_e 8.4, walk_s 6.5; walk_n 4.5 (deliberately slow per request for N/NE/NW).

